About:
~~~~~~

	MsgCount is a bulletin maker for the ABBS bulleting board system.
	It generates a bulletin with statistics about the number of
   messages written the last couple of days.

   Author: Torge Hjorth
           Olav Tryggvasons gate 6
           N-7011 Trondheim
           NORWAY

	        Byte Bazaar BBS +47 73523117

	(sorry, no email at the moment...)



Usage:
~~~~~~

   MsgCount LOGFILES/M/A,BULLETIN/K,DAYS/K/N

   LOGFILES - This option spesifies the logfiles MsgCount scan to
              generate the bulletin. Use full path to the logfile.
              This option must be spesified.

   BULLETIN - This is the AmigaDOS filename for the bulletin that
              MsgCount generates. Keyword and argument *must* be
              specified.

   DAYS     - How many days you wold like included in the bulletin.
              Keyword and argument *must* be specified.



Example:
~~~~~~~~

MsgCount r1.2
Copyright ©1994 Nocturnal Holiday Software, Torge Hjorth.
Generated Sun 10-07-1994  05:06:47

Messages written last 15 days:
